<title>UK: Lehman details two-tranche Yankee bond.</title>
<headline>Lehman details two-tranche Yankee bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Details of the following two-tranche Yankee bond were announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   D.R. INVESTMENT</p>
<p>TRANCHE A</p>
<p> AMT   $409.5 MLN     COUPON     7.10	MATURITY    15.MAY.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.943    PAY DATE   L09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP     REOFFER    99.943    SPREAD	+57 BP</p>
<p>TRANCHE B</p>
<p> AMT   $409.5 MLN     COUPON     7.45	MATURITY    15.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.914    PAY DATE   L09.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  65 BP     REOFFER    99.914    SPREAD	+80 BP</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 10	  GOV LAW     N.Y</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
